# Ignore everything by default
*

# Track config and skills
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!settings.json
!statusline-command.sh
!commands/
!commands/**
!hooks/
!hooks/**
!agents/
!agents/**
# beads-status TUI: source only — the binary is rebuilt locally.
# bin/beads-status is a symlink to tools/beads-status/beads-status, so one
# build updates both: cd tools/beads-status && go build -o beads-status .
!tools/
!tools/beads-status/
!tools/beads-status/README.md
!tools/beads-status/go.mod
!tools/beads-status/go.sum
!tools/beads-status/main.go
